  "body": "A rare development opportunity in sought-after Waiake, offering a substantial flat 1,012m2; site, two existing homes and valuable access from both Beach Road and Waiake Street. For developers, land bankers and investors, this is an opportunity to secure a sizeable coastal landholding with options to explore for the future.\r\n\r\nWith two road frontages, underground services nearby for potential connections, and existing accommodation, the property offers flexibility while you investigate future development possibilities, subject to council approval.\r\n\r\nKey Investment Highlights\r\n- 1,012m2; flat site\r\n- Dual access from Beach Road and Waiake Street\r\n- Potential subdivision or development opportunity, subject to council approval\r\n- Underground services offer potential for convenient connections\r\n- Two existing homes with potential holding income\r\n- Upper-level sea views\r\n- Walking distance to Waiake Beach and local shops\r\n- Sought-after coastal location\r\n- School zones include Torbay School, Northcross Intermediate and Long Bay College\r\n- Ideal for developers, property investors and land bankers\r\n\r\nTwo Existing Homes\r\n1/949 Beach Road (also known as 32 Waiake Street)\r\n- 4+ bedrooms\r\n- 2 bathrooms\r\n- 2 living areas\r\n- Double garage\r\n- Plenty of off-street parking\r\n\r\n2/949 Beach Road\r\n- 3 bedrooms\r\n- 1 bathroom\r\n- Single garage\r\n\r\nThe existing homes provide options to explore rental income while you assess the site's future potential.\r\n\r\nA Coastal Location to Hold.\r\nJust a walk from Waiake Beach, this property combines land and investment potential with a desirable coastal lifestyle. \r\n\r\nLocal shops, cafes, transport links and well-regarded schools are all within reach, while the upper-level sea views add another point of appeal.\r\n\r\nThe vendors are on the move, creating an opportunity for the next owner to consider the possibilities this substantial site presents.\r\n\r\nFlat land. Dual access. Two homes. A sought-after Waiake address.\r\n\r\nThe vendors are on the move - their move could be your best move yet.",
